  "cargo_incremental": "0",
  "implementation": [
    "naome-validator accepts only canonical start/help; naome-verifier accepts only keyless offline verify/help. V0 and state alias dispatch removed.",
    "Setup creates fresh genesis-bound history, signing journal and separate anchors before publishing configuration. Startup only reopens existing authority, including after total store loss.",
    "Key roles and paired registration, canonical peer endpoints, private authority directories, local listener bounds, and occupied control paths are checked before opening custody.",
    "FIFO inputs reject without a writer. Status and shutdown reject unknown JSON fields. Bounded control connection/read/write/queue handling is retained.",
    "Diagnostic output is bounded and cannot own signing state; both streams share one two-second final flush after custody drops. SIGINT and SIGTERM both release custody. Full verifier reports retain their separate three-MiB ceiling.",
    "Devnet relocates initialized anchors intact and synchronizes both parents."
  ],
