    "publication_and_rewards": "Actual four-process publication, citation payment, unavailable provider, partition/healing, cold restart, independent replay and corrupt export rejection.",
    "signing_and_finality": "SIGKILL after completed vote before receipt; exact network retransmission without new proposal; no equivocation; catch-up and next necessary quorum vote; authenticated historical conflict permanently halts.",
    "startup": "Malformed/missing/crossed keys, FIFOs, profile bounds, invalid local bind, occupied socket, duplicate live owner, missing one or all authority directories after an actual signed vote; authority contents and directory presence retained.",
    "control_and_lifecycle": "Partial headers/bodies time out; oversized/malformed/duplicate/unknown fields and valid suffixes rejected; huge history coordinate bounded; fresh valid submission follows failures; sixteen stalled clients cannot block SIGINT/SIGTERM; stalled stdout/startup stderr bounded; strict reopen succeeds.",
    "portable_verifier": "Actual executable replays public golden without keys or writes, rejects corruption, directories, oversized files, symlink/reparse inputs, retired interfaces; Windows device/pipe/ADS cases are included for CI.",
    "output_report": "Conservative full-profile claim-count shape exceeds diagnostic limit and is emitted without truncation."
  },
